WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.611 --> 00:00:04.307
WANDA MAXIMOFF
We are an unusual couple.

00:00:04.307 --> 00:00:06.561
ELIZABETH OLSEN
It was really so fun getting to play

00:00:06.561 --> 00:00:09.332
all these different
decades throughout WandaVision.

00:00:09.357 --> 00:00:10.976
WANDA MAXIMOFF
We just don't know what to expect.

00:00:10.976 --> 00:00:12.778
PAUL BETTANY
And then of course, everything kind of

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.974
breaks down and becomes
an MCU version of the real world.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.214
AGNES
[Gasps] Am I dead?

00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:18.125
VISION
No!

00:00:18.903 --> 00:00:19.887
Why would you think that?

00:00:19.887 --> 00:00:20.920
AGNES
Because you are.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.313
KATHRYN HAHN
I can't believe how it just keeps

00:00:23.313 --> 00:00:29.418
unraveling and unfolding in ways
that I am still shocked and thrilled by.

00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:31.013
JIMMY WOO
Wanda, can you read me?

00:00:31.418 --> 00:00:32.569
MATT SHAKMAN
Everyday it's something different.

00:00:32.569 --> 00:00:35.545
You know, it's high-tech
Marvel with helicopters flying around,

00:00:35.545 --> 00:00:39.227
and the next day it's a
perfect recreation of a 50s sitcom.

00:00:39.227 --> 00:00:40.902
You know, some days it's both.

00:00:40.902 --> 00:00:42.902
VISION
I think something's wrong here.

00:00:44.354 --> 00:00:46.243
PAUL BETTANY
I think it's gonna be really satisfying

00:00:46.243 --> 00:00:50.476
for people when they realize
what is at the heart of this show.

00:00:50.476 --> 00:00:51.490
WANDA MAXIMOFF
This is our home.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:52.928
VISION
Then let's fight for it.

